                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4465: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schurnum</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-06-15T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15, 1922—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>147. Your 260 June 13, 7 p.m.</p>
                <p>You should avoid if possible raising question of recognition since, as stated by
                    you, the change is of administration rather than of government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
